    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lītŏrōsus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the shore, on the
